TI  - Assessing vocational competencies in civil engineering: Lessons from AHELO for future practice
PY  - 2015
Y1  - 2015
JO  - Empirical Research in Vocational Education and Training
T2  - Empirical Research in Vocational Education and Training
VL  - 7
IS  - 1
