especially due to the low-stakes nature of the implementation. Conclusions: As the AHELO study shows, this type of undertaking is significantly complex. There is much room for improvement for future large-scale competency based assessments of this kind. In designing future work for measuring vocational competencies, lessons learnt from AHELO should be duly considered. © 2015 Pearce.
