TI  - Psychometric Properties and Stability of the Student Attitudinal Success Instrument: The SASI-I
PY  - 2016
Y1  - 2016
JO  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ENGINEERING EDUCATION
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF ENGINEERING EDUCATION
J2  - Int. J. Eng. Educ
