TI  - DESIGNING A TOOL TO MEASURE INNOVATION COMPETENCE SELF-PERCEPTION IN ENGINEERING STUDENTS
PY  - 2025
Y1  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings of the International CDIO Conference
SP  - 622
